<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix A Datasets ‣ Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">SEED-Bench.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Implementation Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Hyperparameter Tuning</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix C Hyperparameter Tuning ‣ Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layer for Computing Visual Saliency Map.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix C Hyperparameter Tuning ‣ Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Layers for Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix C Hyperparameter Tuning ‣ Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Visual Attention Enhancement Coefficient.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix C Hyperparameter Tuning ‣ Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Query Attention Enhancement Coefficient.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Capturing Gaze Shifts for Guidance: Cross-Modal Fusion Enhancement for VLM Hallucination Mitigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
